#: data/ui/preferences.ui:483
msgid "Show Trash:"
msgstr "显示回收站:"

#: data/ui/preferences.ui:486
msgid "Show the Trash Bin icon on the dock"
msgstr "在停靠栏上显示回收站图标"

#: data/ui/preferences.ui:803
msgid "Anticipate Icon Zoom:"
msgstr "提前响应图标缩放:"

#: data/ui/preferences.ui:804
msgid ""
"Begins icon magnification as the cursor approaches the dock for a fluid, "
"magnetic feel; disable to strictly pass mouse clicks through to windows "
"positioned immediately behind or above the dock"
msgstr "当光标靠近停靠栏时提前开始图标放大，带来流畅磁吸手感；禁用后可严格穿透鼠标点击至紧随停靠栏后方或上方的窗口"

#: data/ui/preferences.ui:703
msgid "Reserve Screen Space:"
msgstr "保留屏幕空间:"

#: data/ui/preferences.ui:704
msgid ""
"Reserve screen space matching the dock thickness (Panel Mode) so maximized "
"windows tile without overlapping the dock; requires Hide Dock and Icon Zoom "
"to be disabled (automatically turns off if either is enabled)"
msgstr "根据 Dock 厚度保留屏幕空间(面板模式)，使最大化窗口贴边平铺而不覆盖 Dock；需要同时禁用“隐藏 Dock”与“图标缩放”(若启用其中之一将自动关闭)"
